MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][405803] = {name = "[q4]Spore Keeper's Baton", additional_info = "5 sec cast 3\nTools: Runed Enchanting Rod\nReagents:\nResonant Crystal (3), Zaralek Glowspores (200), Illimited Diamond , Runed Writhebark (2), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nIllustrious Insight (#93) , Infuse with Power (#111)\nVendor:\nDustmonger Topuiz\nZone:\nZaralek Cavern\nCost:\n1\n\n[q4]Spore Keeper's Baton\nBinds when picked up\nRanged Wand\n109 - 182 Fire Damage Speed 2.00\n(72.8 damage per second)\n+748 Intellect\n+208 Stamina\n[q2]+ 171 Haste\n[q2]+ 68 Mastery\nDurability 110 / 110\n[q2]Equip: Your spells have a chance to activate the spores inside the baton, causing them to rush to your aid.\n\n If you're aiding an ally, the spores will provide them with 598 Versatility for 12 sec.\n\n If you're attacking an enemy, they will instead deal ( 575 * 12) Nature damage to your target over 12 sec while shielding you for 4740 damage. (12s cooldown)\n70"}
