MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][443028] = {name = "Celestial Conduit", additional_info = "5% of base mana\n{Channeled (4 sec cast)} {1.5 min cooldown}\n[q]Windwalker\n The August Celestials empower you, causing you to radiate [(1100% of Attack Power) * 5] Nature damage onto enemies and [(1100% of Spell Power) * 5] healing onto up to 5 injured allies within 15 yds over 4 sec, split evenly among them. Healing and damage increased by 6% per enemy struck, up to 30%.\n\n You may move while channeling, but casting other healing or damaging spells cancels this effect.\n\nMistweaver\n The August Celestials empower you, causing you to radiate [(1100% of Spell Power) * 5] healing onto up to 5 injured allies and [(1100% of Attack Power) * 5] Nature damage onto enemies within 20 yds over 4 sec, split evenly among them. Healing and damage increased by 6% per target, up to 30%.\n\n You may move while channeling, but casting other healing or damaging spells cancels this effect."}
