MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][445331] = {name = "[q3]Authority of Air", additional_info = "3.5 sec cast 3\nTools: Runed Enchanting Rod\nReagents:\nProfaned Tinderbox , Storm Dust (75), Gleaming Shard (10), Refulgent Crystal (2)\nOptional Reagents:\n[q]Arathor Alterations - Fortified Flames\n\n Permanently enchants a weapon with the Authority of Air, which sometimes beckons a protective wind to your aid when taking damage that absorbs the next 2013 damage dealt to you. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 70.\nTreasure:\nChallenger's Cache\nZone:\nThe Dawnbreaker\n\n[q3]Enchant Weapon - Authority of Air\n\n[q2]Use: Arathor Alterations - Fortified Flames\n\n Permanently enchants a weapon with the Authority of Air, which sometimes beckons a protective wind to your aid when taking damage that absorbs the next 2013 damage dealt to you. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 70.\n70"}
