MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][447876] = {name = "[q3]Ghoulfish Delight", additional_info = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nPrepared Ghoulfish , Simple Stew\nOptional Reagents:\nSecret Ingredient (#318)\n[q]Recipe for 5 servings. Actual number of servings will vary based on cooking skill.\nVendor:\nCaptain Oathmyt\nZone:\nHallowfall\nCost:\n10\n\n[q3]Ghoulfish Delight\nBinds when picked up\n[q2]Use: Restores ( 375000 / 5 * 20) health over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating.\n\n Well Fed\n If you spend at least 10 seconds eating, you will become Well Fed and gain 30 Khaz Algar Fishing Skill and 150 Perception for 1 hour.\n75\n[q]\"One angler's worst nightmare is another chef's delicacy\""}
