MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][451940] = {name = "Azerite Surge", additional_info = "100 yd range\nInstant\n[q]Inhale, stoking your inner flame. Release to exhale, burning enemies in a cone in front of you for [((163.409% of Spell Power)) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 ))] Fire damage, reduced beyond 5 targets. [ Sands of Time : Increases the duration of your active Ebon Might effects by 2 sec ]\n Empowering causes more of the damage to be dealt immediately instead of over time.\n\nI: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 )] over (20 + 0 ) sec.\n\nII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 3)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (7 + 0 )] over (14 + 0 ) sec.\n\nIII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 6)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (4 + 0 )] over (8 + 0 ) sec."}
